OL,3,GNEWSABin strike 'unlikely to end'      
OL,4,Abefore Christmas                       
OL,6,FThe long-running bin strike in         
OL,7,FBirmingham is "quite unlikely" to be   
OL,8,Fresolved by Christmas, the leader of   
OL,9,FBirmingham City Council has said.      
OL,11,FLiberal Democrat Roger Harmer told the 
OL,12,FBBC in September that the dispute      
OL,13,Fbetween the council and members of     
OL,14,Funion Unite over pay and job roles,    
OL,15,Fwhich started in early 2025, could be  
OL,16,Fresolved within weeks.                 
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
