OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSABin strike 'unlikely to end'      
OL,4,Abefore Christmas                       
OL,6,FBut speaking to Politics Midlands      
OL,7,Fnearly three months on as Christmas    
OL,8,Floomed, he said the council was still  
OL,9,Fwaiting for a district auditor to      
OL,10,Fcomment on a framework agreement which 
OL,11,Fhad been reached with Unite.           
OL,13,FHe acknowledged that delays were       
OL,14,Ffrustrating for residents, adding that 
OL,15,Fhe shared their desire to get an       
OL,16,Fagreement in place.                    
